      "message": "BTW, if (in step 7 of your 2nd timeline) we update `SkXPS::Options`, then I think it is unavoidable to update the clients (at least those clients who didn\u0027t use the default `SkXPS::Options` and actually set the 2-argument-encode-callback).",
      "parentUuid": "f657c439_5bfd5f5a",
      "revId": "9529ec2c0dd174527fa9ded88f4ca6bde0219e87",
